      "text": "http : / / www . indianexpress . com / news / dozens - injured - as - 6 . 1magnitude - quake - hits - indonesias - aceh / 1136656 / Dozens <3 injured> as <4 6 . 1 - magnitude quake> <5 hits> Indonesia's Aceh Tue Jul 02 2013 , 14 : 58 hrs A strong <6 6 . 1 - magnitude earthquake> <8 struck> Indonesia's northwestern province of Aceh today , <1 causing> buildings to <7 collapse> and <9 injuring> at least 50 people . The <10 quake> <11 hit> inland at 0737 GMT at a <21 depth of just 10 kilometres> , 55 kilometres south of Bireun and 72 kilometres southeast of Reuleuet , the US Geological Survey <19 said> . \"We have received around 50 people with injuries suffered when the walls of their houses collapsed , \" Ema Suryani , a doctor at a health clinic in Lampahan city , Bener Meriah district , told AFP . \"The injuries vary from open wounds to broken bones . \" Injured people had been transported from several affected villages in two trucks , she said . People also <12 ran> out of buildings <22 in panic> in the provincial capital Banda Aceh as the <13 quake> <14 shook> houses for around one minute , an AFP journalist at the scene <20 said> . A massive <16 quake> <15 struck> off Aceh in 2004 , <2 sparking> a <17 tsunami> that <18 killed> 170 , 000 people in the province on Sumatra and tens of thousands more in countries around the Indian Ocean . Indonesia sits on the Pacific \"Ring of Fire\" where continental plates collide , causing frequent seismic and volcanic activity .",
